
<Warning>
`IgnoreAuditFieldsJsonConverterFactory` is obsolete as of EasyAF 5.0. Call `IgnoreAuditFields()` on your `JsonSerializerOptions` instead.
</Warning>

```csharp
var options = new JsonSerializerOptions
{
    DefaultIgnoreCondition = JsonIgnoreCondition.WhenWritingDefault,
}.IgnoreAuditFields();
```

See [IgnoreAuditFieldsJsonConverter](/api-reference/CloudNimble/EasyAF/Core/Converters/IgnoreAuditFieldsJsonConverter) for migration steps, and for the 5.0 output changes and how to restore the 4.x output.
